    ("custody_agreeing_fills_missing_record_time", "custody_acknowledgement",
     "Custody is held without a record time, as a receiver that kept none recorded it. An agreeing restatement supplies the record time from the receiver's clock and nothing else.",
     held_one_custody(recorded=None), custody(1, CUSTODY_AT, "active"), None),
    ("custody_conflicting_supplies_no_record_time", "custody_acknowledgement",
